      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/5/f5f3a39104edd548c5602e76dce5f332166f86dd.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/f5f3a39104edd548c5602e76dce5f332166f86dd\" title=\"111\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/5/f5f3a39104edd548c5602e76dce5f332166f86dd_2_690x107.jpeg\" alt=\"111\" data-base62-sha1=\"z5MYp4gIl42zhowlJP9JkHxKEuV\" width=\"690\" height=\"107\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/5/f5f3a39104edd548c5602e76dce5f332166f86dd_2_690x107.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/5/f5f3a39104edd548c5602e76dce5f332166f86dd_2_1035x160.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/5/f5f3a39104edd548c5602e76dce5f332166f86dd_2_1380x214.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBF8F8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">111</span><span class=\"informations\">1582×246 44.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\nwill anybody guide…why amount is not showing with conversion value into $ ?</p>",
